_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_bloominsummer_02_20","text":"so will sand castles eventually crumble.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_bloominsummer_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_bloominsummer_02_21","text":"But...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_bloominsummer_02_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_bloominsummer_02_22","text":"But...?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_bloominsummer_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_bloominsummer_02_23","text":"That won't happen to the sand castle","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_bloominsummer_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_bloominsummer_02_24","text":"you and I built.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_bloominsummer_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_bloominsummer_02_25","text":"It will last forever in this photo","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_bloominsummer_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_bloominsummer_02_26","text":"and in my heart.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_bloominsummer_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_bloominsummer_02_27","text":"Hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_bloominsummer_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_bloominsummer_02_28","text":"Do you think if we watch the cherry blossoms together,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_bloominsummer_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_bloominsummer_02_29","text":"they'll remain in bloom forever as well?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_bloominsummer_02_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_bloominsummer_02_30","text":"Of course.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_bloominsummer_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"saku